            "review_title": "Review at Kaffe Haus",
            "review_text": "Erwin Manalad\nOlongapo, Philippines16 contributions\n0\nGreat Food and the owner is really Cool\nJun 2014\nI'm waiting for my taxi going back to the airport then I came across this cool little KAFFE HAUS, food is really great and the KEBAB are just awesome, I even brought some and eat them at the airport, the coffee is great plus the owner and I, talked about great food, about the Philippines and BRUNO MARS Songs, he even played some for me, such a cool guy! Highly Recommend this! And I love the the interior , really cozy and laid back! Definitely going back here when I go back to Hanoi!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 4, 2014",
