            "review_title": "Review at Kaffe Haus",
            "review_text": "Richard R\nHeidelberg, Germany2 contributions\n0\nWe went there 3 times in 2 days. Awesome!\nMay 2014 • Friends\nWe liked the Döner Kebab in the Kaffe Haus so much that we went there three times during our short stay in Hanoi. \n\nThe Kebab was really tasty (as Germans we are used to a l o t of Kebabs) and the price was very good - You definitely have to try the Kebab Baguette. \n\nBesides of the Kebab, I really liked the Matcha tea.\n\nWe also chatted with the owner who is really nice and even speaks a few words of German ;) \n\nIn conclusion: Highly recommended. You won't get such a good Kebab in Hanoi anywhere else.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2014",
